      "text": "\\frac{4}{x^2} = 4x^{-2}"
    },
    {
      "text": "F(x) = 4 · \\frac{x^{-1}}{-1}"
    },
    {
      "text": "F(x) = -\\frac{4}{x}"
    },
    {
      "text": "F(-2) = -\\frac{4}{-2} = 2"
    },
    {
      "text": "F(-4) = -\\frac{4}{-4} = 1"
    },
    {
      "text": "F(-2) - F(-4) = 2 - 1 = 1"
    },
    {
      "text": "1",
